#. @context: Warning in the multilingual dialog about stamping posts that have no language
#: src/ui/dash/settings/LanguageContent.tsx
msgid "{count, plural, one {# existing post} other {# existing posts}} with no language yet will be marked as {language}."
msgstr "{count, plural, other {已有 # 篇文章尚未標記語言，將全部標記為 {language}。}}"

